[Term]
id: ECAO:2000583
name: non-skeletogenic mesoderm
def: "The subset of the mesoderm germ layer that will give rise to all mesoderm tissue derivatives but the endoskeleton; e.g. muscles, coeloms, pigment cells, blastocoelar cells." []
is_a: ECAO:2000547 ! mesoderm
relationship: develops_from ECAO:2000582 ! presumptive non-skeletogenic mesoderm
